('awin-beyond-memories-memory-light-basetm-essentials-wood-small-natural-87175-42087673915','Beyond Memories','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Memory Light Base™ - Essentials Wood - Small-Natural","59","USD","Beyond Memories","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42087673915&a=2893129&m=87175","The Memory Light Base™ Small in Essentials Wood is the entry-tier illumination stand for 3D Memory Crystals from Beyond Memories®. A compact wooden base with a soft warm-white LED that fires through a centered dispersor under the crystal, lifting the engraving out of shadow and into clean tabletop view. Sized for the Small and Medium crystals across every shape - rectangle, heart, cube, hexagon, arc - and finished in either glossy black lacquer or polished rosewood to match your decor. The light"]'),
