('awin-bookingradar-2-day-colca-canyon-classic-tour-131140-46310227269','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["2-Day Colca Canyon Classic Tour","131.67","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227269&a=2893129&m=131140","This 2-day tour will take you to know the deepest canyon in the world, and admire the majestic flight of the Condor. Discover the breathtaking Colca Canyon on a 2-day trip, a paradise of natural beauty that will leave you in awe. During your journey through the classic Colca Valley, you`ll explore charming Andean villages, witness simply stunning panoramic views of Arequipa`s majestic volcanoes, and marvel at the fascinating flight of the Andean Condor. Don`t miss the chance to experience an ama"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-2-day-colca-canyon-trek-131140-46310227388','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["2-Day Colca Canyon Trek","58.73","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227388&a=2893129&m=131140","This 2-day tour will allow you to hike around the deepest canyon of the world, and visit traditional small towns and admire the Condor flight. Explore the deepest canyon in the world in our 2-day Colca Canyon Trek tour with us. Be surprised by beautiful landscapes and amazing mountains in this fantastic place. Discover the depth of the canyon with this amazing hike tour, and enjoy a well-deserved rest in the middle of the Sangalle oasis. Live a different adventure enjoying the spectacular Colca "]'),
('awin-bookingradar-2-day-small-group-max-10-guests-ephesus-priene-miltos-didyma-tour-131140-46310227018','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["2-Day Small-Group ( Max. 10 Guests ) Ephesus & Priene - Miltos - Didyma Tour","149.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227018&a=2893129&m=131140","This 2-day mini-group ( max 10 pax ) tour will take you not only to the narrow streets of the ancient Ephesus but also will take you to Priene, Miletus and Didyma as well. This 2-day mini-group tour will take you not only to the narrow streets of the ancient Ephesus but also will take you to Priene, Miletus and Didyma as well. Ephesus is one of the most modern, richest, and most developed city of its times. While you are walking through history on marble streets, with Celcus Library, the gate of"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-2-day-tour-lake-titicaca-uros-floating-islands-amantani-island-taquile-island-131140-46310227389','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["2-Day Tour Lake Titicaca: Uros Floating Islands, Amantani Island & Taquile Island","98.33","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227389&a=2893129&m=131140","This 2-day tour will take you to explore the amazing islands around Lake Titicaca and share experiences with the local families. Visit the stunning Lake Titicaca, and the beautiful islands surrounding it. Start the tour exploring the Uros floating islands, and then live one night with the friendly community of Amantani Island. To end this fantastic excursion, we will go to Taquile Island, to marvel at its beautiful landscapes and delight you with your local food. Enjoy Puno with our 2-day tour L"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-3-day-colca-canyon-trek-adventure-131140-46310227242','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["3-day Colca Canyon Trek Adventure","88.23","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227242&a=2893129&m=131140","This 3-day adventure tour will take you to hike one of the deepest canyons in the world, and admire unique fauna around as the impressive Condor''s flight. Enjoy an outdoor hike surrounded by beautiful mountains and spectacular landscapes, with our 3-day tour Colca Canyon Trek Adventure. Explore with us the deepest canyon in the world, and spend an unforgettable time in this incredible place. A perfect tour for trek lovers in the middle of nature."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-3-day-lima-travel-package-131140-46310227185','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["3-Day Lima Travel Package","101.11","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227185&a=2893129&m=131140","This 3-day tour will allow you to have a pleasant stay in the city of Lima, and explore it on your own. Visit Lima city is an unforgettable experience. If you like to travel on your own, and explore for yourself new places, this stay package in Lima, it''s perfect for you. Discover its historic center and the beautiful colonial era buildings that surround it, and delight yourself with the exquisite Peruvian gastronomy."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-4x4-tour-at-the-corner-of-atins-131140-46310227354','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["4X4 Tour At The Corner Of Atins","98.35","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227354&a=2893129&m=131140","Dunes and 4x4, enjoy this adventure tour. The village of Atins has attracted the attention of the tourists that pass by. Perhaps this is explained by the perfect combination formed between the Preguiças River, the dunes, the lagoons that form in the dunes and the beach. On this tour we will immerse many in the lagoons with transparent waters."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-4x4-tour-to-lagoa-bonita-large-lencois-131140-46310227259','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["4X4 Tour to Lagoa Bonita (Large Lençois)","59.95","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227259&a=2893129&m=131140","An excursion that will blow your mind, come and feel your adventure spirit. The ride is a great opportunity for beginner adventurers! Climb a dune with the help of a rope in a unique setting! And then you can bathe in beautiful lagoons and finally be amazed by a spectacular sunset. All this in a single afternoon!"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-abu-dhabi-city-tour-with-louvre-museum-from-abu-dhabi-131140-46310226870','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Abu Dhabi City Tour with Louvre Museum from Abu Dhabi","70.48","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226870&a=2893129&m=131140","Surprise Tourism offers an exciting Abu Dhabi city tour where you can visit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, Louvre Museum and Etihad Towers. Discover the best of Abu Dhabi''s top attractions on our 5-Hour City Sightseeing Tour. This tour showcases the city''s rich history and modern highlights, featuring iconic spots like Sheikh Zayed Mosque, a Photo stop at Etihad Towers, and the Louvre Museum. What sets this tour apart? You''ll enjoy a guided sightseeing experience with a professional guide, starting "]'),
('awin-bookingradar-abu-dhabi-city-tour-with-louvre-museum-from-dubai-small-group-131140-46310226873','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Abu Dhabi City Tour with Louvre Museum from Dubai Small Group","95.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226873&a=2893129&m=131140","A private tour of Abu Dhabi City allows you to learn about the city''s culture and history at your own pace. Abu Dhabi, the capital of the United Arab Emirates, is ranked as one of the best cities to live in, and it was recognized as the safest city in the world for 2019. Abu Dhabi is just a two-hour drive from one of the busiest cities in the world—Dubai. Compared to Dubai, Abu Dhabi has a calm pace, avoiding the needless hustle and bustle of larger cities. However, this does not mean that the w"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-abu-dhabi-morning-desert-safari-with-sandboarding-131140-46310226889','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Abu Dhabi Morning Desert Safari with Sandboarding","95.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226889&a=2893129&m=131140","Book Your Abu Dhabi Desert Safari with Dune Bashing, Sand Boarding and Camel Ride from Surprise Tourism. Are you looking for a perfect start to your Abu Dhabi tour? How about an adventurous ride in a stunning, quiet desert? With the rolling landscape and the vast openness of the desert, the Desert of Al Khatim is a beautiful stretch of land located 82km from Al Ain and 78km from Abu Dhabi. The morning desert safari is full of excitement and thrilling experiences. The 4x4 Jeep takes you deep into"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-abu-dhabi-private-tour-with-qasr-al-watan-gold-cappuccino-at-emirates-palace-131140-46310226887','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Abu Dhabi Private Tour with Qasr Al Watan & Gold Cappuccino at Emirates Palace","111.03","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226887&a=2893129&m=131140","During the six-hour Abu Dhabi city tour, you will see the city''s best attractions and learn about its history and current development. Abu Dhabi, the capital of the United Arab Emirates; is the largest of the seven emirates in the country. Abu Dhabi is the most visited city after Dubai. Abu Dhabi has a lot to offer its visitors, from skyscrapers to beautiful beaches to iconic buildings. The four hours morning Abu Dhabi city Tour is well crafted to showcase the best attractions of the city coveri"]'),
