('awin-bookingradar-adventure-for-the-rafting-enthusiasts-on-the-struma-river-131140-46310227035','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Adventure for the Rafting Enthusiasts on the Struma River","101.18","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227035&a=2893129&m=131140","Need a safe adrenaline boost? This one is for you. We guarantee you a great experience among the beauty of the Kresna Gorge and the irresistible rapids of the Struma River. A wonderful combination of active fun, team excitement and refreshing splashes! We have 1-1.5 hours in water depending on the water level. Total survival is about 2.5-3 hours. The length of the track is 11 km. The main route is Class 3 of the International Six-dimensional Rock of Difficulty and is one of the most interesting,"]'),
