('awin-bookingradar-horse-riding-lessons-at-the-heart-of-the-rose-valley-131140-46310227037','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Horse Riding Lessons at the Heart of the Rose Valley","32.97","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227037&a=2893129&m=131140","Enjoy horse-riding at one of the best bases in Bulgaria. Wonderful and graceful animals - horses can not leave anyone indifferent! With proven facts, horseback riding is claimed to have a good effect on your body''s physical condition and also has a great impact on your mental harmony and stress reduction. Try to get good habits of this ancient art - horse riding!"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-horseback-riding-tour-lanin-national-park-and-mapuche-culture-131140-46595285828','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Horseback Riding Tour: Lanin National Park and Mapuche Culture","136.85","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46595285828&a=2893129&m=131140","Journey into dense forests in Lanín National Park on a pleasant horseback ride during this half-day excursion, just outside of San Martin de los Andes. You''ll gain insight into the Mapuche settlement of Quila Quina Village from a guide who’s from this indigenous community. Your trusty steed clops along at a steady pace, suitable for both first-time and experienced riders. Along the way, snap pictures of the Andes mountains, Lago Lácar and Lanín Volcano. Numbers are limited to 12 people on this s"]'),
