('awin-bookingradar-humantay-lake-day-trip-from-cusco-131140-46310227187','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Humantay Lake Day Trip from Cusco","125.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227187&a=2893129&m=131140","This full day tour will take you to hike the Andes Mountains with amazing landscapes to Humantay Lake. Cusco is located in the Andes Mountain Range surrounded by beautiful mountains with crystalline water lagoons and breathtaking landscapes. This amazing place is worth to visit and will give you a sensation of peace and calmness. You will live a unique adventure with our Humantay Lake hike!"]'),
