('awin-bookingradar-introductory-dive-in-eilat-131140-46310226842','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Introductory Dive in Eilat","80.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226842&a=2893129&m=131140","Discover the vibrant underwater world of Eilat with our Introductory Dive! This introductory dive gives you a look into the underwater life in the Red Sea. The dive has been designed to give you a taste of the beautiful world under the water. This is a great activity that one person or the whole family can enjoy. If you ever wanted to see marine life up close this is definetly for you. The whole strip of coral beach is filled with places for diving."]'),
