('awin-bookingradar-jujuy-city-sightseing-tour-131140-46310227236','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Jujuy City Sightseing Tour","48.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227236&a=2893129&m=131140","Discover the city of Jujuy in this beautiful city tour! Stroll through Jujuy, officially known as San Salvador de Jujuy, with a guide on this walking tour. Learn about the city''s history, architecture, culture, and traditions through visits to landmarks like the church of Christ of the Brotherhood, the Police History Museum, and the Mitre Theatre. Opt to tour the Archaeological Museum to enhance your experience."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-jungle-fly-adventure-at-the-jungle-in-iguazu-131140-46310227123','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Jungle Fly: Adventure at the Jungle in Iguazu","59.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227123&a=2893129&m=131140","Come and be part of this jungle adventure in Iguazu! Escape into the jungle on this half-day trekking and ziplining tour from Puerto Iguazu. A great way to delve deeper into the verdant landscapes without getting bored or lost, this small-group tour gives you the opportunity to climb up the trees and cross hanging bridges and zipline through the canopy. You’ll also go on a guided trek through the jungle and learn more about the birds and wildlife who call these forests home."]'),
