('awin-bookingradar-kayaking-to-uros-floating-islands-at-lake-tititica-131140-46310227387','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Kayaking to Uros Floating Islands at Lake Tititica","79.50","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227387&a=2893129&m=131140","This full day tour will take you in an adventure kayaking the Lake Titicaca, from Uros Floating Islands until Taquile Island. Live an incredible adventure kayaking the highest navigable lake in the world: Lake Titicaca. This spectacular place, has a lot of islands among, like Uros floating islands and Taquile Island. Explore the lake by kayak, visiting communities and learning from their ancestral customs."]'),
