('awin-bookingradar-mendoza-river-rafting-zipline-adventure-experience-131140-46310227309','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Mendoza River Rafting & Zipline Adventure Experience","118.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227309&a=2893129&m=131140","Shoot the rapids in the Potrerillos Valley on this full-day Mendoza river rafting tour from Mendoza City. A great opportunity for adventure lovers, as the Mendoza River Rafting Tour will take you to Potrerillos Valley, to spend a day of fun in the nature. Together with a specialised guide, you will sails this Class II (moderated) rapids. Then you can enjoy some free time to explore the surroundings of Del Plata mountain range, an area of great natural beauty. Enjoy the thrill of several Class II"]'),
