('awin-bookingradar-private-wine-tasting-and-vineyards-tour-from-mendoza-131140-46310227119','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Private Wine Tasting and Vineyards Tour from Mendoza","141.35","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227119&a=2893129&m=131140","Enjoy a Wine Tasting and Vineyard Tour and discover the ancient and new wine making process! When staying in Mendoza, discover one of Argentina''s most famous wine-producing regions with a private tour of the Bodegas vineyards. Visit wineries to meet growers and watch traditional and modern production methods in action, and then taste top-notch local varietals with the help of expert sommeliers and your guide. A gourmet lunch with wine pairings is included with the full-day option."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-privately-cycle-the-european-capital-of-culture-plovdiv-131140-46310227036','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Privately Cycle the European Capital of Culture - Plovdiv","101.18","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227036&a=2893129&m=131140","Superb tour in the European Capital of Culture for 2019 - Plovdiv. We embark on an unforgettable adventure in which we’ll pass by: 1.The Rowing Canal – it’s 2.2km long. There’s a park and fresh food stands where we can get some energy and healthy breakfast! 2.The highest hill in Plovdiv which has an amazing view and a place for picnic and rest. 3.Tzar Simeon’s garden 4.The singing fountains – famous meeting point of the locals 5.Some other secret places we’ll keep for your surprise After 3 hours"]'),
