('awin-bookingradar-quebrada-de-las-conchas-hiking-from-cafayate-131140-46310227111','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Quebrada De Las Conchas Hiking from Cafayate","135.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227111&a=2893129&m=131140","Visit the Quebrada de las Conchas from Cafayate: an area of great natural beauty with very striking rock formations! The excursion consists of a tour through the Quebrada de las Conchas, where the wind and water have carved, after many centuries, very curious and strange shapes. Our tour from Cafayate combines sections traveled by vehicle, with trekking, making it a walk suitable for all kinds of people!"]'),
