('awin-bookingradar-tafi-del-valle-half-day-tour-from-tucuman-131140-46310227179','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tafi del Valle Half-Day Tour from Tucuman","92.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227179&a=2893129&m=131140","Enjoy this Tafi del Valle Half-Day Tour from Tucuman! Wind your way through forested gorges and lush valleys to Tafí del Valle on this half-day tour from Tucumán. Admire the Jesuit architecture and alpine scenery of the town at 2,000 meters above sea level, then visit nearby landmarks like the Los Sosa River Gorge, La Angostura Dam and the Los Menhires archaeological site."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tango-porteno-tango-show-with-optional-dinner-and-tango-class-131140-46310227237','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tango Porteño Tango Show with Optional Dinner and Tango Class","60.65","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227237&a=2893129&m=131140","The meticulous scenery and costumes at the Tango Porteño create the ultimate framework to transport you to that enchanting time when all Buenos Aires was Tango. If you want to live the golden age of Argentine tango, Tango Porteño is the right place to go. Have a great tango show and indulge yourself in the sophisticated decoration, the incredible staging and live the tango at its best, accompanied by top quality cuisine. If you choose the Dinner option, you''ll indulge in a delectable gourmet mea"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-terrace-houses-ephesus-ruins-with-skip-the-line-131140-46310226942','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Terrace Houses Ephesus Ruins with Skip The Line","39.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226942&a=2893129&m=131140","This is a customized half-day private tour with a personal tour guide. Visit Ancient Ephesus and Terrace Houses. Visit > Ancient Ephesus and Terrace Houses The tour has private and Small Group Tour options. Visit Ephesus and Terrace Houses, walk on the ancient roads where Mother Mary, St John and St paul walked and see monuments such as Celsus Library, Great Theather, Trajan Fountain, Odeon Temple and more, learn history about early Christians and Romans from your expert local guide. Take photos"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-teteven-ribaritsa-all-sights-self-guided-131140-46310227406','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Teteven & Ribaritsa All Sights Self-Guided","21.52","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227406&a=2893129&m=131140","The most advanced way to explore at your own pace. Fully personalized electronic and audio guide with all info and logistics for you. Live maps and route for you to follow. An unique product which brings you stress-free travel at your own pace in Teteven & Ribaritsa. Very flexible and easy for the customer."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-the-best-of-rio-christ-redeemer-sugarloaf-maracana-downtown-131140-46310227142','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["The Best of Rio - Christ Redeemer - Sugarloaf - Maracanã - Downtown","122.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227142&a=2893129&m=131140","We offer you our excursion CHRIST REDEEMER STATUE, SUGAR LOAF TOURS, MARACANÃ STADIUM that takes you visit, in one day, the two most important tourist attractions in the city of Rio de Janeiro. Our tour begins with a pick-up at the passengers'' hotels to go to Corcovado hill and see the statue of Christ the Redeemer, located at 710 meters high. Besides visiting this emblematic place, we will be in contact with nature, since Corcovado hill is located within the Tijuca Forest National Park, the lar"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-the-sillar-route-in-arequipa-131140-46310227299','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["The Sillar Route in Arequipa","23.33","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227299&a=2893129&m=131140","This half day tour will take you to discover where the ashlar comes from, the main material of building in the city of Arequipa. The Sillar Route Day Tour is a fantastic opportunity to know where the sillar comes from, and is the main material of monuments, temples and mansions of Arequipa city, also known as the White City. We will visit impressive streams, admiring unique desert landscapes, and we will have the opportunity to see how the expert masters process this material of volcanic nature."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-the-small-secrets-of-the-balkan-villages-with-a-bicycle-131140-46310227032','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["The Small Secrets of the Balkan Villages with a Bicycle","50.02","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227032&a=2893129&m=131140","Experience authentic villages, dense forests and splendid panoramas at its best. With this tour you will discover the \"little secrets\" of the Balkan - authentic villages, dense forests, splendid panoramas and numerous legends. We will lead you through the \"most romantic village in Bulgaria\" - Bozhentsi, but we will do it in a very special way: we will enter the village through the \"back entrance\" and leave it through the \"window\". Bozhentsi has been declared an architectural and historical reser"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-thracian-tombs-tour-in-the-valley-of-the-thracian-kings-131140-46310227043','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Thracian Tombs Tour in the Valley of the Thracian Kings","44.34","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227043&a=2893129&m=131140","Enjoy a shift back in time in one of the most interesting destinations in Bulgaria. The Thracian tombs and sanctuaries are the only almost entirely preserved representatives of the monumental cult architecture of the ancient Thracians. The main merit of their preservation to this day is that almost all of them are buried in tombstones. There are over 60,000 Thracian mounds on the territory of Bulgaria, of which only about 1000 are surveyed. We offer you to embark on a fascinating journey through"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tickets-for-ferrari-world-131140-46310226917','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tickets for Ferrari World","94.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226917&a=2893129&m=131140","Ferrari World: Packed with over 37 thrill rides, Ferrari-inspired shows, and a host of dining options, this amusement park is designed to gear up fun times with loved ones Under the largest space-frame structure ever built in human history, you can explore a range of rides for young kids and adults Upgrade your experience to include an open meal voucher at Ferrari World. This high-octane theme park has the world''s highest rollercoaster, a karting track inspired by an actual Formula One venue, an"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tickets-for-louvre-abu-dhabi-skip-the-line-131140-46310226914','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tickets for Louvre Abu Dhabi: Skip the Line","20.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226914&a=2893129&m=131140","Louvre Abu Dhabi was designed by Jean Nouvel and opened on Saadiyat Island in November 2017. Architect Jean Nouvel is the man behind the design. Some of his work include the Copenhagen Concert Hall, in Denmark, the Torre Agbar in Barcelona and the 100 Eleventh Avenue in Manhattan,. Experience the Louvre''s stunning new location on Abu Dhabi''s Saadiyat Island See original works by Da Vinci, Matisse, Mondrian, Monet, and more in a universal art museum that''s arranged chronologically – so you can se"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tickets-for-warner-bros-worldtm-abu-dhabi-131140-46310226915','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tickets for Warner Bros. World™ Abu Dhabi","94.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226915&a=2893129&m=131140","Watch your childhood memories come back to life when you meet Bugs Bunny, Scooby-Doo, Tom and Jerry, the Flintstones, and more Keep the kids entertained on 29 state-of-the-art rides and awesome interactive family attractions Explore themed restaurants and themed lands including Bedrock, Dynamite Gulch, Cartoon Junction, Gotham City and Metropolis. Take a trip back to your childhood at the world’s first ever Warner Bros. indoor theme park in Abu Dhabi! This one-of-a-kind immersive experience flin"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tickets-for-yas-waterworld-131140-46310226916','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tickets for Yas Waterworld","85.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226916&a=2893129&m=131140","Scream to your heart''s content as you brave some of the world’s most thrilling water rides or simply chill out on a lazy, relaxing river current or at a play pool Experience one of the world’s best water parks. It has 43 rides, five of them world firsts like Bubble''s Barrel – the largest surfable sheet wave in the world Enjoy a day out at the first water park in the Middle East to receive a ''1'' on the Estidama Pearl Rating System for sustainability. Yas Waterworld is quite simply the complete da"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tierra-del-fuego-national-park-with-optional-end-of-the-world-train-131140-46310227172','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tierra del Fuego National Park with optional End of the World Train","66.52","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227172&a=2893129&m=131140","Discover the landscapes of Tierra del Fuego National Park with optional End of the World Train. After being picked up at your hotel in the center of Ushuaia, where you will take an exciting ride on the last 4.5 miles. The park has dramatic scenery, with waterfalls, forests, mountains and glaciers. The Senda Costera (Coastal Path), connecting Ensenada Bay to Lapataia Bay on Lago Roca, is a popular hiking trail within the park. Forests of Antarctic beech, lenga beech and coihue in the lower elevat"]'),
