('awin-bookingradar-tour-larco-museum-with-dinner-131140-46310227101','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour Larco Museum with dinner","95.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227101&a=2893129&m=131140","This evening tour will take you to visit the most prestigious museum in Lima city with a delicious Peruvian dinner included. Let’s enjoy a unique evening tour in the most prestigious museum of the city. We will climb the lit pre-Columbian pyramid where the Larco Museum is built, and discover the treasures of ancient Peru while we walk along its halls and galleries. At the end, we will be able to enjoy an exquisite dinner in a magical and cozy atmosphere with a view to the beautiful gardens."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-of-the-motorboat-the-paradisiac-islands-of-angra-dos-reis-131140-46310227161','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour Of The Motorboat The Paradisiac Islands Of Angra Dos Reis","52.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227161&a=2893129&m=131140","The perfect tour to visit the paradise islands in a quiet boat. This tour is the ideal medium for those who want the islands around Angra dos Reis with a mixture of comfort and tranquility of a speedboat. During the approximately five hours of walking, stops are made on six of the main islands of Angra dos Reis. They are Cataguases, Botinas Islands, Beach of the Farm, Beaches of Jurubaíba, known like Dentist, Vitorino, where is the Restaurant Canto das Canoas, and Piedade. The return is done in "]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-aguas-belas-beach-131140-46310227337','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Aguas Belas Beach","33.88","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227337&a=2893129&m=131140","This tour is the ideal option to enjoy a day of relaxation and fun! For those looking for a trip on the outskirts of Fortaleza that completes the trip with a day of tranquility and beautiful views, this tour is ideal. Going to Águas Belas is one way to make the trip even more memorable and to make it stand out from any other. 55 km from Fortaleza, the beach \"where the sun kisses the moon and the river embraces the sea\" welcomes tourists from all over the country throughout the year. The journey "]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-canoa-quebrada-beach-131140-46310227257','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Canoa Quebrada Beach","45.08","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227257&a=2893129&m=131140","We invite you to visit the highest beach around Fortaleza: Canoa Quebrada. Besides the historical differential, since it was recognized nationally and worldwide as a paradise for naturalists in the 70s, this beach is called the pearl of the east coast of Caerá, for its incredible landscapes that surprise anyone. With our tour you will be able to relax, walk on the beach and swim in crystalline waters."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-cumbuco-beach-131140-46310227258','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Cumbuco Beach","30.12","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227258&a=2893129&m=131140","Relaxing and enjoying the sea in Cumbuco. Cumbuco Beach is very close to Fortaleza, only 38 kilometers away, in the district of Caucaia, and is considered one of the most traditional areas of the state. The attractions that make all its visitors fall in love vary: there are those who are enchanted by the natural beauties, there are those who dare to try the adventure options in the place, and others who choose the comfort of an infrastructure where nothing is missing."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-lagoinha-beach-131140-46310227191','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Lagoinha Beach","41.41","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227191&a=2893129&m=131140","Spend a day at the beach among the dunes and coconut trees. Lagoinha Beach is about 110 kilometers from Fortaleza and is considered a paradise on the Ceará coast. In addition to its natural beauty, visitors are welcomed by an infrastructure that guarantees comfort and tranquility during the trip. Besides relaxing in the sand and bathing in the sea, we will have the opportunity to take one of the most characteristic rides on the beach known as the \"trio\", because it mixes three forms of locomotio"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-mangue-seco-with-boat-tour-131140-46310227099','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Mangue Seco With Boat Tour","51.50","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227099&a=2893129&m=131140","We will have a beautiful schooner or boat tour through the Real river! Tieta do Agreste''s Globo novel Network Paradise, Mangue Seco is a wonderful village. On this tour, we will have the opportunity to spend an entire day in a very quiet and peaceful region. Come and have fun in beautiful and almost deserted beaches."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-morro-branco-fontes-beach-131140-46310227192','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Morro Branco & Fontes Beach","37.65","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227192&a=2893129&m=131140","An unmissable day of cliffs and crystal-clear water. We invite you to know two incredible beaches of the east coast of Ceará: Morro Branco and Fuentes. Together, they make up a scenario of enormous orange cliffs on the seashore that contrast perfectly with the blue of its crystalline waters. Besides the dazzling nature, the two beaches also offer a tourist infrastructure to receive visitors with many options for their comfort, allowing the trip to be even more perfect. To move from one beach to "]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-morro-de-sao-paulo-island-131140-46310227334','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour To Morro De São Paulo Island","86.39","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227334&a=2893129&m=131140","We will leave Salvador in a boat of Big Sea or Ferry Boat, crossing the Bay of All Saints towards Itaparica. There, we will continue along the road to the municipality of Valença by the Funil Bridge, towards Ponta do Curral. Finally, a journey of only ten minutes by speedboat will leave us in Morro de São Paulo, where we will take a walk to the fourth beach, stopping to swim and relax."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-mundau-beach-131140-46310227336','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Mundau Beach","82.83","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227336&a=2893129&m=131140","The little fishing village is ready to welcome you on your beach day. Mundaú Beach is located 154 kilometers from Fortaleza and is characterized by being still very well preserved since it has been little explored by its visitors. The exuberant nature, little modified by the actions of man, calls the attention of all those who know it, who are enchanted by it. The beach is in a fishing village and, at the same time, has an ideal tourist infrastructure to receive people without hindering the ecos"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tour-to-presidente-figueiredo-amazon-waterfalls-131140-46310227280','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tour to Presidente Figueiredo: Amazon Waterfalls","127.73","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227280&a=2893129&m=131140","This is a tour designed for eco-tourism lovers! Come with us to one of the most beautiful regions in the northwest of Brazil, where we will visit the incredible waterfalls of President Figueiredo, a truly magical landscape, where we will have time to swim and explore the area. We will also observe the Amazon rainforest and learn about the native flora and fauna with our local guide, as well as enjoy a traditional Brazilian lunch in a local restaurant."]'),
