('awin-bookingradar-tours-in-historical-park-near-varna-tickets-131140-46310227041','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tours in Historical Park near Varna + Tickets","40.93","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227041&a=2893129&m=131140","Unique for Bulgaria, the Balkan peninsula and Europe! A must-see sight to be experienced fully! Immerse yourself with this self-guided tour in the unique atmosphere of Bulgarian history in its most significant eras, which are embodied in reality through unique interactive attractions and replicas of the largest monuments, as well as a reproduced atmosphere through national costumes and handicrafts of different ages collected on one place.This is one of the largest in Europe historic and cultural"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tree-climbing-131140-46310227285','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tree Climbing","78.86","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227285&a=2893129&m=131140","The tour combines hanging bridges and zip line where we will always travel accompanied by an expert guide for your total safety. In each section the difficulty will increase, and then end in a fun zipline ride down the waters of the Formoso River. The tour starts with the passengers pick up from their hotels in the center of Bonito, to travel about 6 km to the area of the Cabanas Hotel, located in a privileged area, between two crystal clear rivers and a vast green area. There, the tour will tak"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-trolley-tour-through-the-city-buzios-131140-46310227127','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Trolley Tour Through the City Buzios","22.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227127&a=2893129&m=131140","The great overview of the main beaches of Buzios. The tour will be held in Trolley, allowing us to dazzle with incredible views along the promenade while we feel the fresh air and the sea breeze to enjoy with all the senses. We will visit 12 beaches: Canto Beach, Armação Beach, Bones, João Fernandes Beach, João Fernandinho Beach, Ponta do Criminoso, Brava Beach, Foca Beach, Ponta da Lagoinha and Ferradura Beach. In addition to these beautiful beaches, we will visit the viewpoint of João Fernande"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tronador-hill-day-trip-from-bariloche-131140-46310227295','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tronador Hill Day Trip from Bariloche","55.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227295&a=2893129&m=131140","If you want to spend a day surrounded by nature and explore the mountains and lakes of Patagonia, do not hesitate to book this tour to Cerro Tronador. Be awed by the thunderous sound of calving glaciers at Cerro Tronador (Tronador Hill), the highest mountain in the Andean Lake District, located in the heart of Nahuel Huapi National Park. Soak up the breathtaking scenery on a day trip from Bariloche. You’ll pass gorgeous mountain streams and cross the Manso River before a short walk to the glacie"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-tropical-islands-schooner-ride-131140-46310227333','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Tropical Islands Schooner Ride","50.23","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227333&a=2893129&m=131140","We invite you to make an unforgettable tour of the largest, most beautiful and charming bay of Brazil: the Baía de Todos os Santos. With our tour TROPICAL ISLANDS SCHOONER RIDE we take you to navigate the calm waters, enjoying the natural landscape, making a stop to dive into the waters of the Ilha dos Frades and finally we will have lunch on the beach of Ponta de Areia."]'),
('awin-bookingradar-trujillo-city-tour-archaeological-museum-131140-46310227399','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Trujillo City Tour & Archaeological Museum","46.67","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227399&a=2893129&m=131140","This 3-hour tour will take you to discover the wonderful historic center of Trujiilo, and one of the most important museums in the north of Peru. Our excursion City Tour & Archaeological Museum is the perfect choice for those who wish to get to know the most outstanding attractions of Trujillo in a few hours. As an important city during the colony, Trujillo houses beautiful buildings and mansions of that times that constitute true architectural treasures, and in this opportunity, we will take yo"]'),
