('awin-bookingradar-ultimate-kayaking-in-iskar-reservoir-131140-46310227033','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Ultimate Kayaking in Iskar Reservoir","89.81","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227033&a=2893129&m=131140","A great activity for the adventure seekers very close to Sofia. For lovers of active recreation, fresh emotions and unusual experiences we offer to try a kayaking trip! A trip to Bulgaria''s largest area and volume reservoir - Iskar will be breathtaking! Kyaking at Iskar reservoir does not require pre-training and is suitable even for children over 10 years old. From March to November, our adventure starts with the departure from Sofia. Every brave goes through professional instruction on water b"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-unique-tasty-bike-tour-in-the-balkans-131140-46310227044','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Unique & Tasty Bike Tour in the Balkans","89.81","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227044&a=2893129&m=131140","An extraordinary experience for the adventurous ones. This tour will not only take you to significant places in the Balkans, but will also reveal some of his \"culinary secrets\". In a casual setting you will enjoy dishes prepared on non-traditional and Balkan recipes. The so-called \"delicious stops\" are support points for key locations along the route and perhaps even just because these stops you will want to go the distance over and over again. The Uzana area on the Balkan mountain ridge is a pl"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-uros-taquile-islands-full-day-tour-with-lunch-131140-46310227223','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Uros & Taquile Islands Full Day Tour with lunch","55.07","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227223&a=2893129&m=131140","This full day tour will take you to explore the Lake Titicaca, from Uros Floating Islalnds until Taquile Island, with a traditional lunch. Join us on our boat trip at the Lake Titicaca, an adventure that will allow us to explore the famous floating islands of the Uros, whose most outstanding feature is that they were built by men. We will also visit the wonderful island of Taquile, to observe vestiges of the Inca culture that still remain today. To finish the day, you will witness a typical cult"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-villavicencio-natural-reserve-half-day-tour-from-mendoza-131140-46310227136','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Villavicencio Natural Reserve Half-Day Tour from Mendoza","42.62","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227136&a=2893129&m=131140","Get up close to the diverse wildlife of the Andes mountains on this half-day tour to the Villavicencio Natural Reserve from Mendoza. Take a 5-hour guided tour to the Villavicencio Natural Reserve, which is known for its beauty and its mineral springs. Home to eagles, condors, pumas, guanacos and ostriches as well as flowering cacti and many other animals and plants, the reserve covers 172,974 acres (70,000 hectares). Tour the foothills of the Andes and visit the Monument of Canota and the haunti"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-vinicunca-rainbow-mountain-131140-46310227186','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Vinicunca - Rainbow Mountain","125.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227186&a=2893129&m=131140","This full day tour will take you to explore the beautiful mountain landscapes of the Andes and the Rainbow Mountains. Enjoy a wonderful outdoor hike to the amazing Rainbow Mountain Vinicunca, where you will be in contact with nature and wildlife, with the opportunity to admire a spectacular colorful mountain range forming a beautiful rainbow, surrounded by delightful landscapes. Have a good time with this challenging trek taking amazing photos, and visit Rainbow Mountain with us, a highly recomm"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-visit-to-lavender-fields-lavender-oil-extraction-demo-131140-46310227026','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Visit to Lavender Fields & Lavender Oil Extraction Demo","40.93","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227026&a=2893129&m=131140","Bulgaria is super famous with rose oil and lavender. Today you would have the chance to experience lavender fields and oil. Bulgaria has been known for centuries with its rose oil, which is the best in the world. In recent years, another miracle has happened - she overtook France - the world leader in lavender production. From 2012 Bulgaria is officially number 1 in the world for the production of lavender oil. Bulgaria and France together produce about one-third of the world''s lavender oil. Bul"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-walking-city-tour-lima-and-catacombs-131140-46310227155','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Walking City Tour Lima and Catacombs","30.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227155&a=2893129&m=131140","This half day tour will take to discover the historic center of the City of Kings and the amazing catacombs of San Francisco. Discover the amazing historic center of Lima exploring beautiful streets full of history and colonial architecture. This tour will take you to visit incredible catacombs of San Francisco. The City of Kings offers amazing tourist attractions such as impressive mansions, palaces, squares and churches, that you will explore with us in this fantastic walking tour. Get to know"]'),
