('awin-bookingradar-yellow-boats-sightseeing-tour-prices-starts-from-100-131140-46310226876','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Yellow Boats Sightseeing Tour - Prices starts from $100","100.00","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310226876&a=2893129&m=131140","Experience the best view of iconic landmarks from the sea with our Yellow Boat Sightseeing Tour of Dubai. See Dubai from the water as you''ve never seen it before! Our day tours will leave you enchanted by Dubai''s enchanting islands, fantastic architecture, and beaches. From Dubai Marina and JBR to Atlantis and the Burj Al Arab, our spectacular sightseeing tours take you around Dubai''s most exclusive waterfront developments. There are four exciting Dubai tours to choose from: Premium Tour (99 Min"]'),
