('awin-bookingradar-zip-line-via-ferrata-experience-in-the-rhodope-mountains-131140-46310227057','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Zip Line & Via Ferrata Experience in the Rhodope Mountains","55.71","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227057&a=2893129&m=131140","Relax and enjoy the adrenaline in truly beautiful surroundings. If you are adrenaline hunters and you like to test your senses - it''s an attraction for you!!! Amazing emotions from one of the most charming places in Bulgaria! Rhodope Mountain is a magical place, best characterized by the words of Ivan Vazov - \"Who has not seen the Rhodopes in his life, he has not seen Bulgaria!\" Choose between the 2 options at the time of booking - only zip line or zip line & via ferrata. The activity takes plac"]'),
('awin-bookingradar-zipline-adventure-from-mendoza-in-potrerillos-valley-131140-46310227370','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','','["Zipline Adventure from Mendoza in Potrerillos Valley","116.64","USD","BookingRadar","Tourist Attractions","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227370&a=2893129&m=131140","Ride a zipline over Potrerillos Valley on this guided tour from Mendoza! Ride a zipline over Potrerillos Valley on this 6.5-hour guided tour, leaving from Mendoza. The Base Tour includes five different ziplines that give views of the valley floor, the snowcapped mountains in the distance and the surrounding vineyards. Choose the Adrenaline Tour to add a final zipline that takes you over the fast-moving Mendoza River."]'),
