('awin-ftd-12-stem-moonlight-white-rose-bouquet-with-ginger-vase-fedex-87919-42907454050','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["12 Stem Moonlight White Rose Bouquet With Ginger Vase - FedEx","49.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454050&a=2893129&m=87919","Uplifting, bright, and fit for any phase of life. A farm-fresh selection of a dozen white roses fills a clear glass vase to dazzle everyone you love. Packaged and shipped in a box, may arrive in bud form."]'),
('awin-ftd-8-inch-fragrant-gardenia-plant-fedex-87919-42907453532','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["8-inch Fragrant Gardenia Plant - FedEx","64.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453532&a=2893129&m=87919","Gorgeous and graceful, give this gardenia plant to remind loved ones that you are thinking of them for any reason. This fresh plant comes with lush green leaves to delight or comfort your recipient. Please note that this plant may arrive in bud form, only for the blooms to beautifully open after it arrives."]'),
('awin-ftd-a-baby-girl-balloon-bunch-87919-42907453913','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["A Baby Girl Balloon Bunch","39.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453913&a=2893129&m=87919","Celebrate that precious new addition with this New Baby GIRL Balloon Bunch. This fun and festive bouquet arrives with 2 mylar balloons surrounded by 6 latex balloons, all tied together with a ribbon. The It''s A Girl mylar balloon designs will vary. (Photo shows both Boy and Girl options. Only the Girl themed balloons are included in this item.)"]'),
('awin-ftd-all-for-you-bouquet-87919-42907454463','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["All For You Bouquet","59.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454463&a=2893129&m=87919","Your recipient always takes care of everyone else - they are thoughtful, they are kind, and they are completely deserving of a special surprise consisting of bright, beautiful blooms. Sunlit yellow Asiatic Lilies, sunflowers, red carnations, red spray roses, yellow Peruvian Lilies, purple larkspur, and ivy vines are expertly arranged in a clear glass bubble bowl vase to express your appreciation in floral style. A wonderful birthday, thank you, or thinking of you gift!"]'),
('awin-ftd-alluring-elegance-bouquet-87919-42907454127','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Alluring Elegance Bouquet","89.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454127&a=2893129&m=87919","An illuminating array of florals brings an air of elegance to any room it''s placed. This arrangement features refined florals like lilies, Queen Anne''s Lace and Veronica in a clear glass vase to add a touch of sophisticated style to your special occasions."]'),
('awin-ftd-always-remembered-bouquet-87919-42907454281','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Always Remembered Bouquet","97.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454281&a=2893129&m=87919","The Always Remembered Bouquet is a colorful symbol of a life that will never be forgotten. Purple tulips, blue delphinium, lavender mini calla lilies, purple carnations, lavender larkspur and green hydrangea are gorgeously arranged in a clear purple designer glass vase to create an emotional tribute that conveys your deepest sympathies. GOOD bouquet includes 18 stems. Approximately 20H x 12W. BETTER bouquet includes 23 stems. Approximately 21H x 13W. BEST bouquet includes 28 stems. Approximately"]'),
('awin-ftd-always-smile-luxury-bouquet-87919-42907453800','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Always Smile Luxury Bouquet","99.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453800&a=2893129&m=87919","The play of pink against green and white can''t help to bring a mirthful beauty to this stunning bouquet. The blushing swirl of the roses and lisianthus bring a sweet drama to this arrangement offset by clusters of green and cream hydrangea. With a tinted vase to add even further interest, sparkling as it catches the light through each facet of it''s unique design, this gorgeous flower arrangement is ready to set the stage for a treasured moment of pure happiness."]'),
