('awin-ftd-mom-s-heart-pink-calla-lily-fedex-87919-44636524422','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Mom''s Heart Pink Calla Lily - FedEx","59.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=44636524422&a=2893129&m=87919","Soft pink blooms create an instant sense of warmth and affection. This cheerful calla feels thoughtful without being overdone or too formal. A sweet spring gesture that works for everyday moments and quiet surprises alike."]'),
('awin-ftd-mom-springtime-belgian-chocolate-covered-sweets-fedex-87919-45145078262','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Mom Springtime Belgian Chocolate - Covered Sweets - FedEx","94.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45145078262&a=2893129&m=87919","Caramel bits, chocolate bark, and nut clusters. Need we say more about why this is the ultimate gift If we do, it also comes with fun designs like the word MOM specially written with rich, creamy chocolate lettering"]'),
('awin-ftd-momma-bear-cookies-and-treats-gift-box-fedex-87919-46795652014','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Momma Bear Cookies and Treats Gift Box - FedEx","69.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46795652014&a=2893129&m=87919","The name says it all. Our Momma Bear Gift Box is the sweetest present for that special caregiver in your life. Whether you re looking for the perfect gift for your mom, aunt, or friend, we know this gift set is sure to bring a smile to their face this Mother s Day."]'),
