('awin-ftd-snake-plant-fedex-87919-44913235330','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Snake Plant - FedEx","69.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=44913235330&a=2893129&m=87919","With its tall, swordlike leaves, Snake Plants are beautiful and distinct plants to have in any home. They are popular for their air purifying and low maintenance qualities. Put this plant in any corner of your home ,bright or low-light, and watch it thrive."]'),
