('awin-ftd-southwest-sophistication-dishgarden-87919-42907453961','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Southwest Sophistication Dishgarden","89.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453961&a=2893129&m=87919","Nothing is more on trend right now than the fascinating foliage of succulent plants! This dishgarden is a nod to everything that we love about the landscapes of the southwest, bringing together a mix of succulents in a rustic square wooden planter lined with large river rocks for further interest and appeal. A beautiful, stylish, and thoughtful gift your recipient will admire for years to come with proper care."]'),
('awin-ftd-spathiphyllum-plant-87919-42907453712','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Spathiphyllum Plant","69.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453712&a=2893129&m=87919","The Spathiphyllum Plant, also known as the Peace Lily, is a beautiful gift to convey your wishes for tranquility and serenity. This plant is an ideal gift for a range of occasions including sympathy, expressing your condolences, or for the loss of a loved one. It displays white conical blooms that stand out against its dark green foliage."]'),
