('awin-ftd-thoughts-and-prayers-fedex-87919-42907453851','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Thoughts and Prayers - FedEx","94.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453851&a=2893129&m=87919","Send a message to let them know you are thinking of them during this difficult time. They will appreciate your thoughts and prayers. A natural kraft box holds a comforting book of hope and tasteful treats including soothing tea, Ghirardelli chocolate squares, dried fruit, and more."]'),
('awin-ftd-true-charm-bouquet-87919-42907454060','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["True Charm Bouquet","49.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454060&a=2893129&m=87919","The True Charm Bouquet has a vintage look and styling that creates a gift of grace and beauty your special recipient will absolutely adore. Beginning with sunlit yellow roses, this fresh flower arrangement has a standout design as it then brings together the blushing hues of lavender daisies, hot pink statice, and hot pink Peruvian Lilies, perfectly accented with lush greens. Presented in a clear glass vase, this stunning flower bouquet is arranged just for you to make today a memorable moment f"]'),
('awin-ftd-truly-stunning-bouquet-87919-42907454254','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Truly Stunning Bouquet","59.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454254&a=2893129&m=87919","This dreamy jewel toned bouquet combines bold color and eye catching texture to make a statement. Featuring a thoughtful array of both roses and lilies, this dazzling assortment is bound to impress your recipient."]'),
('awin-ftd-turquoise-birthday-orchid-garden-orchid-garden-with-pick-and-card-fedex-87919-45505321991','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Turquoise Birthday Orchid Garden - Orchid Garden with Pick and Card - FedEx","129.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45505321991&a=2893129&m=87919","Celebrate their big day with the extraordinary beauty of our Birthday Orchid Garden. Designed in a sleek white ceramic pot, four stunning stems of vibrant turquoise orchid blossoms create an elegant and lasting birthday gift they''ll cherish. Complete with a festive andquot;Happy Birthdayandquot; pick, this beautiful orchid garden is the perfect way to make their celebration even more memorable."]'),
('awin-ftd-turquoise-birthday-orchid-garden-orchid-garden-with-pick-fedex-87919-45505321993','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Turquoise Birthday Orchid Garden - Orchid Garden with Pick - FedEx","124.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45505321993&a=2893129&m=87919","Celebrate their big day with the extraordinary beauty of our Birthday Orchid Garden. Designed in a sleek white ceramic pot, four stunning stems of vibrant turquoise orchid blossoms create an elegant and lasting birthday gift they''ll cherish. Complete with a festive andquot;Happy Birthdayandquot; pick, this beautiful orchid garden is the perfect way to make their celebration even more memorable."]'),
('awin-ftd-ultimate-sausage-and-cheese-gift-box-fedex-87919-45954589234','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Ultimate Sausage and Cheese Gift Box - FedEx","109.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45954589234&a=2893129&m=87919","There''s plenty of savory flavors to love in this gift! Beef summer sausage pairs deliciously with a wide variety of cheeses and two kinds of crispy crackers and mustard for even more taste combinations. Oh, and did we mention it comes with a sweet treat Send this to your favorite party host or serve it at your next gathering for the easiest appetizers ever."]'),
('awin-ftd-unicorn-belgian-chocolate-dipped-cupcakes-fedex-87919-42907453695','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Unicorn Belgian Chocolate Dipped Cupcakes - FedEx","64.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453695&a=2893129&m=87919","Give someone a whimsical surprise with these Unicorn Belgian chocolate dipped cupcakes! Hand decorated with unicorn icing designs and sprinkles, this gift is a colorful way to celebrate Artisan crafted Belgian chocolate covered treats crafted in a small batch kitchen cupcakes hand dipped in Belgian milk, dark, and white chocolate cake flavors: vanilla or chocolate Hand decorated with unicorn icings or celebration sprinkle mix. Arrives in an elegant gift box. Since these are crafted by our artisa"]'),
('awin-ftd-uplifting-moments-arrangement-87919-42907454158','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Uplifting Moments Arrangement","129.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454158&a=2893129&m=87919","This beautiful, blushing tribute to a life well-lived is an excellent choice for expressing your sympathy in a color palette that reflects the taste of the deceased. Handcrafted in gorgeous shades of pink from soft-to-saturated by a local FTD artisan florist this lovely arrangement includes roses, carnations, Dendrobium orchids, snapdragons and Asiatic lilies accented with graceful greens in a rectangular bowl of brushed silver-tone metallic plastic. It brings a welcome, refreshing note to the s"]'),
('awin-ftd-vision-in-ivory-rose-and-calla-lily-bouquet-deluxe-with-vase-fedex-87919-44133197981','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Vision in Ivory Rose and Calla Lily Bouquet - Deluxe with Vase - FedEx","64.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=44133197981&a=2893129&m=87919","A stunning selection of roses and calla lilies come together to create this illuminating bouquet. Picked fresh from the farm, let this grand arrangement take center stage in your home and add a touch of elegance wherever it''s placed."]'),
('awin-ftd-weekend-escape-bouquet-87919-42907453731','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Weekend Escape Bouquet","54.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453731&a=2893129&m=87919","Momentarily step away from the everyday by taking a deep breath of these blushing lilies, roses, and stock. Whether you are celebrating, cheering up, or simply saying I miss you, these pastel florals will make their day."]'),
('awin-ftd-welcome-baby-gift-basket-blue-fedex-87919-46264089189','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Welcome Baby Gift Basket - Blue - FedEx","119.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46264089189&a=2893129&m=87919","Send your warmest congratulations with a beautiful gift basket created to welcome a new baby. Complete with a soft baby blanket, cuddly teddy bear, keepsake piggy bank, and an assortment of sweet treats and snacks, this thoughtful gift is perfect for celebrating baby''s arrival and helping parents feel appreciated, too."]'),
('awin-ftd-white-kalanchoe-87919-42907454274','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["White Kalanchoe","49.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907454274&a=2893129&m=87919","Loving expressions of comfort and consolation flourish beautifully with this blooming Kalanchoe plant. Covered in a canopy of tiny white blooms, this full and flowery herbaceous plant sends an understated expression of heavenly hope, so appropriate and so meaningful at a time of sorrow and loss. It makes a beautiful addition to a wake or funeral service, and would be a welcomed gift when sent to the home of grieving friends and family so they know you are thinking of them. Its simple, lovely whi"]'),
('awin-ftd-winter-woodland-mini-tree-fedex-87919-46526928418','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Winter Woodland Mini Tree - FedEx","74.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46526928418&a=2893129&m=87919","Winter Woodland Mini Tree is not only going to celebrate the holiday with you, but also continue to brighten your day throughout the colder weather months. The Cardinal ornaments symbolize hope, love, and joy during the holiday season. Simple, elegant, and the perfect level of Christmas harmony, this tree makes an excellent gift."]'),
('awin-ftd-wishes-and-blessings-bouquet-87919-42907453872','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Wishes and Blessings Bouquet","74.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453872&a=2893129&m=87919","An array of blushing pink blooms come together beautifully to express your condolences in our Wishes andamp;amp; Blessings Bouquet. Each bloom is designed to share sympathies and bring comfort to those experiencing sadness during a time of loss."]'),
('awin-ftd-wonderland-bouquet-87919-44636524432','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Wonderland Bouquet","99.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=44636524432&a=2893129&m=87919","Fantastical lilies, enchanting hydrangea, and whimsical roses come together to create a mesmerization of a bouquet. This true piece of art makes an exquisite gift for a special day, moment of remembrance, and so much more."]'),
('awin-ftd-wrapped-in-holiday-cheer-mini-tree-fedex-87919-46638739219','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Wrapped in Holiday Cheer Mini Tree - FedEx","69.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46638739219&a=2893129&m=87919","Bows and Christmas charms go together in the Wrapped in Holiday Cheer tree. Celebrate the season by not just placing presents under the tree, but also making your tree a gift itself. Add elegance and sophistication to your celebration."]'),
('awin-ftd-yellow-colors-florist-designed-bouquet-87919-42907453742','FTD','home-decor','plants-flowers','','["Yellow Colors Florist Designed Bouquet","49.90","USD","FTD","Flowers","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42907453742&a=2893129&m=87919","Can''t decide on which bouquet to send? Let the florist design something special. Using the season''s best flowers, this bouquet will arrive beautifully arranged in a glass vase and reflect the amount you have spent. Bright and ready to cast a ray of sunshine on your special recipient''s day with its combination of sunlit yellow flowers, this bouquet will make an excellent gift for any of life''s special moments."]'),
