('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-all-you-need-journal-127767-45347983030','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["All You Need Journal","125.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983030&a=2893129&m=127767","Generously scaled with clean, unlined pages, the All You Need Journal invites a free-flowing approach—equally suited for writing, drawing, or collecting thoughts as they come. Crafted with a focus on material and form, this John Lennon and Paul McCartney inspired journal offers a sense of enduring appeal, feeling at once iconic and inherently collectible."]'),
