('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-breezy-mini-book-stack-127767-45347983268','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Breezy Mini Book Stack","165.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983268&a=2893129&m=127767","Draped in a blue plaid, the Breezy Mini Book Stack brings to mind open windows, shifting light, and effortless days, where classic pattern feels lightened and unfussy. The result is crisp yet inviting, offering a touch of casual charm that feels both familiar and refreshed."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-brock-horn-dish-127767-45347983278','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Brock Horn Dish","80.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983278&a=2893129&m=127767","Handcrafted in India from natural horn and delicately balanced on a graceful curve, the Brock Horn Dish stands alone as an object of interest or to display curated objects with a rough-hewn artisanal touch."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-bunny-charity-bag-127767-45347983295','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Bunny Charity Bag","40.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983295&a=2893129&m=127767","“Her Majesty” Like her majesty Queen Elizabeth II this little Chihuahua is not your typical pampered sovereign. Being an avid hunter and sportswoman, she prefers to spend her time in the field giving chase to rabbits and squirrels. Although she is dressed in her finest attire for this photo she can most often be found in her hunting parka or cable knit sweater. Rescued by the owners of Regina-Andrew during a trip to Tucson, AZ. Bunny found the perfect home where she is allowed to run in open spa"]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-calista-book-stack-127767-46329699245','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Calista Book Stack","250.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46329699245&a=2893129&m=127767","Soft pink tones meet playful pattern in the Calista Book Stack. Reptile-inspired texture and delicate grasscloth stripes create an expressive mix of finishes, bringing a fresh, unexpected pop of color to a layered interior."]'),
