('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-carlisle-book-stack-127767-46329699246','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Carlisle Book Stack","275.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46329699246&a=2893129&m=127767","The Carlisle Book Stack evokes the quiet character of a well-appointed library or private study. Layered finishes in putty, deep brown, and warm tan create a softly weathered, heritage-inspired look, adding depth and a sense of collected history to bookshelves, built-ins, and richly layered interiors."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-caspian-ceramic-bowl-white-127767-45347983382','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Caspian Ceramic Bowl (White)","200.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983382&a=2893129&m=127767","The Caspian Ceramic Bowl is a texture-forward piece, with unique ceramic ridges and design details that feel like artwork. The dramatic texture makes it work as a stand-alone piece or a stylish storage option. Add to this bowl’s organic beauty with decorative balls in natural jute, twine, or moss."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-caspian-ceramic-vase-white-127767-45347983383','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Caspian Ceramic Vase (White)","120.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983383&a=2893129&m=127767","The Caspian Ceramic Vase is a texture-forward piece, with unique ceramic ridges and design details that feel like artwork. It is stunning yet subtle, and would look equally beautiful by itself or with natural greenery."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-cedric-rug-black-swatch-127767-45347983403','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Cedric Rug (Black) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983403&a=2893129&m=127767","Inspired by the art of tiling, the Cedric Rug brings modern geometry to life. With repeating motifs and easy-care construction, the design is made to stand up to busy spaces."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-cedric-rug-blue-swatch-127767-45347983408','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Cedric Rug (Blue) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983408&a=2893129&m=127767","Inspired by the art of tiling, the Cedric Rug brings modern geometry to life. With repeating motifs and easy-care construction, the design is made to stand up to busy spaces."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-cedric-rug-red-swatch-127767-45347983415','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Cedric Rug (Red) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983415&a=2893129&m=127767","Inspired by the art of tiling, the Cedric Rug brings modern geometry to life. With repeating motifs and easy-care construction, the design is made to stand up to busy spaces."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-chandra-bookend-set-blackened-zinc-127767-45347983418','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Chandra Bookend Set (Blackened Zinc)","250.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983418&a=2893129&m=127767","Elevate your decor with the Chandra Bookends, featuring a unique, textured surface inspired by traditional paper mache techniques. Finished in a refined matte brown/grey, these bookends highlight the beauty of handcrafted design. Their artisanal charm and natural elegance make them a perfect addition to any bookshelf or desk, adding a touch of Boho-chic style and sophistication to your eclectic living space."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-chandra-bookend-set-grey-127767-45347983419','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Chandra Bookend Set (Grey)","250.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983419&a=2893129&m=127767","Elevate your decor with the Chandra Bookends, featuring a unique, textured surface inspired by traditional paper mache techniques. Finished in a refined matte brown/grey, these bookends highlight the beauty of handcrafted design. Their artisanal charm and natural elegance make them a perfect addition to any bookshelf or desk, adding a touch of Boho-chic style and sophistication to your eclectic living space."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-chatham-wood-lantern-natural-127767-45347983460','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Chatham Wood Lantern (Natural)","250.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983460&a=2893129&m=127767","A beautiful lattice pattern emerges from solid wood to create the Chatham Wood Lantern’s signature coastal appeal. Blackened Iron components add a stately touch and the piece takes on a different feel when warmly lit, creating romantic light play within and on surrounding surfaces. Place this coastal beauty in an entryway, living room, or above a kitchen island or table."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-chatham-wood-lantern-white-127767-45347983461','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Chatham Wood Lantern (White)","250.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983461&a=2893129&m=127767","A beautiful lattice pattern emerges from solid wood to create the Chatham Wood Lantern’s signature coastal appeal. Blackened Iron components add a stately touch and the piece takes on a different feel when warmly lit, creating romantic light play within and on surrounding surfaces. Place this coastal beauty in an entryway, living room, or above a kitchen island or table."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clam-bowl-large-ambered-silver-leaf-127767-45347983509','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clam Bowl Large (Ambered Silver Leaf)","270.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983509&a=2893129&m=127767","Inspired by the natural elegance of a clamshell, the Large Clam Bowl serves as a statement piece, and a functional bowl. Its ambered silver leaf interior enhances the intricate detailing of the shell, capturing the essence of coastal beauty. Perfect for a sideboard or coffee table, this substantial bowl adds a touch of shoreline charm to your living space."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clam-bowl-small-ambered-silver-leaf-127767-45347983510','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clam Bowl Small (Ambered Silver Leaf)","130.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983510&a=2893129&m=127767","Inspired by the natural elegance of a clamshell, the Small Clam Bowl serves as a statement piece, and a functional bowl. Its ambered silver leaf interior enhances the intricate detailing of the shell, capturing the essence of coastal beauty. Perfect for a sideboard or coffee table, this substantial bowl adds a touch of shoreline charm to your living space."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clara-rug-2-6x8-runner-127767-45347983513','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clara Rug 2.6x8 Runner","184.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983513&a=2893129&m=127767","Distressed, vintage designs offer an elevated tone for the Clara Rug. The rug features Southwestern-inspired medallions and a thin geometric border in tones of tan and cream. This machine washable rug is stain resistant and easy to clean, perfect for homes with children and pets. The 100% polyester fibers allow for maximum cleanability while maintaining a soft hand."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clara-rug-swatch-127767-45347983516','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clara Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983516&a=2893129&m=127767","Distressed, vintage designs offer an elevated tone for the Clara Rug. The rug features Southwestern-inspired medallions and a thin geometric border in tones of tan and cream. This machine washable rug is stain resistant and easy to clean, perfect for homes with children and pets. The 100% polyester fibers allow for maximum cleanability while maintaining a soft hand."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clayton-rug-blue-swatch-127767-45347983529','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clayton Rug (Blue) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983529&a=2893129&m=127767","This boldly textured indoor or outdoor area rug offers a light-hued accent to patios and foyers alike. Easy to clean and durable with a weather-resistant polypropylene construction, this light gray layer boasts a braided design for an on-trend Scandinavian look."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clayton-rug-brown-swatch-127767-45409643473','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clayton Rug (Brown) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45409643473&a=2893129&m=127767","This boldly textured indoor or outdoor area rug offers a light-hued accent to patios and foyers alike. Easy to clean and durable with a weather-resistant polypropylene construction, this light gray layer boasts a braided design for an on-trend Scandinavian look."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clayton-rug-tan-swatch-127767-45409643474','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clayton Rug (Tan) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45409643474&a=2893129&m=127767","This boldly textured indoor or outdoor area rug offers a light-hued accent to patios and foyers alike. Easy to clean and durable with a weather-resistant polypropylene construction, this light gray layer boasts a braided design for an on-trend Scandinavian look."]')
) AS src(slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url, payload)) AS parsed
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, price=EXCLUDED.price, currency=EXCLUDED.currency,
  brand=EXCLUDED.brand, merchant=EXCLUDED.merchant, category=EXCLUDED.category, department=EXCLUDED.department,
  product_type=EXCLUDED.product_type, image_url=EXCLUDED.image_url, affiliate_url=EXCLUDED.affiliate_url,
  description=EXCLUDED.description, source_data=EXCLUDED.source_data;
INSERT INTO awin_catalog_products
  (slug, name, price, currency, brand, merchant, category, department, product_type, image_url, affiliate_url, description, source_data)
SELECT slug, data->>'product_name', (data->>'search_price')::numeric, data->>'currency', brand,
  data->>'merchant_name', data->>'category_name', department, product_type, image_url,
  data->>'aw_deep_link', data->>'description', data
FROM (SELECT slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url,
  to_jsonb(jsonb_object(ARRAY['product_name','search_price','currency','merchant_name','category_name','aw_deep_link','description'], ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(payload::jsonb)))) AS data FROM (VALUES
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clever-mouse-stocking-holder-127767-45884853029','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clever Mouse Stocking Holder","60.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45884853029&a=2893129&m=127767","Deck your mantel or shelves with the Clever Mouse Stocking Holder. This charming character is crafted from recycled cast aluminum with an antique gold finish, each stocking holder combines playful design with functionality. The weighted base ensures that filled stockings stay securely in place."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clever-mouse-wall-mount-127767-45347983554','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clever Mouse Wall Mount","90.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983554&a=2893129&m=127767","A delightful sight for the wall, these cast aluminum mounts with antique gold finish are all set for display. A keyhole in the back of the piece allows for hanging securely."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clive-pendant-polished-nickel-127767-45347983555','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clive Pendant (Polished Nickel)","100.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983555&a=2893129&m=127767","A dimensional socket and cloth cord would make the Clive pendant right at home in a cool urban loft. Create a cool statement by hanging this versatile pendant in multiples with vintage bulbs."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clove-candle-holder-set-127767-45347983556','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clove Candle Holder Set","140.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983556&a=2893129&m=127767","Introduce classic elegance to your home with the Clove Candle Holder Set. Each holder boasts antique-style candle cups with intricate bobeche detailing and dramatic antiqued gold bases. The varying heights create a balanced, multi-level effect, adding a refined and graceful touch to any room."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clove-stem-buffet-table-lamp-with-black-shade-127767-45347983563','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clove Stem Buffet Table Lamp With Black Shade","280.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983563&a=2893129&m=127767","Add a touch of elegant style to your home with the Clove Stem Buffet Lamp. With a dramatic base finished in antiqued gold, this table lamp brings a touch of sophistication to any decor. A black linen shade completes the refined look."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-clove-stem-buffet-table-lamp-with-natural-linen-shade-127767-45347983564','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Clove Stem Buffet Table Lamp With Natural Linen Shade","280.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983564&a=2893129&m=127767","Add a touch of elegant style to your home with the Clove Stem Buffet Lamp. With a dramatic base finished in antiqued gold, this table lamp brings a touch of sophistication to any decor. A natural linen shade completes the refined look."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-cobble-mini-book-stack-127767-45347983568','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Cobble Mini Book Stack","165.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983568&a=2893129&m=127767","Tailored in a brown plaid, the Cobble Mini Book Stack calls to mind worn pathways, where heritage pattern meets an easy, lived-in spirit. The result is rich yet approachable, offering a layer of depth that feels both enduring and effortlessly inviting."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-cobra-sconce-oil-rubbed-bronze-127767-45347983573','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Cobra Sconce (Oil Rubbed Bronze)","160.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983573&a=2893129&m=127767","With clean lines and handsome details, the Cobra Sconce is a versatile fixture that can be positioned horizontally or vertically. Especially ideal for narrow spaces and hard-to-fit places in the home, the sconce''s double bulb design provides a consistent warm glow."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-coco-metal-vase-127767-45347983574','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Coco Metal Vase","160.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983574&a=2893129&m=127767","The Coco is the quintessential styling piece for your coastal oasis. While its original purpose is to serve as a vase, the Coco also doubles as a stylish sculpture that is bound to dress up a bookshelf or end table in your home."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-cora-horn-bowl-set-127767-45347983591','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Cora Horn Bowl Set","170.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983591&a=2893129&m=127767","Handcrafted by artisans from natural horn, and trimmed with brass finished metal accents, the Cora Horn Bowl set proves that good things come in threes. Imported from India, this trio brings form and function to display lovingly curated objects and to coral everyday necessities."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-crazy-train-journal-127767-45347983604','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Crazy Train Journal","125.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983604&a=2893129&m=127767","Generously scaled with clean, unlined pages, the Crazy Train Journal invites a free-flowing approach—equally suited for writing, drawing, or collecting thoughts as they come. Crafted with a focus on material and form, this Ozzy Osborne inspired journal offers a sense of enduring appeal, feeling at once iconic and inherently collectible."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-curious-duck-stocking-holder-127767-45884853034','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Curious Duck Stocking Holder","60.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45884853034&a=2893129&m=127767","Deck your mantel or shelves with the Curious Duck Stocking Holder. This charming character is crafted from recycled cast aluminum with an antique gold finish, each stocking holder combines playful design with functionality. The weighted base ensures that filled stockings stay securely in place."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-daisy-rug-white-swatch-127767-45347983619','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Daisy Rug (White) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983619&a=2893129&m=127767","In easy-to-decorate tones of cream, the light and airy colorway of the Daisy rug anchors room with versatility and neutral appeal. The texture-rich wool pile features a ribbed construction that lends unique linear details to the dynamic geometric patterns. Braided fringe accents and a thin flatweave border add a dose of global flair."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-daphne-rug-blue-127767-45347983621','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Daphne Rug (Blue)","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983621&a=2893129&m=127767","A classic handwoven construction with clean, contemporary appeal, the Daphne rug brings interest and grounding texture to on-trend spaces. The Daphne rug features a heathered blue, cream, and gray colorway and a ridged weave that adds dimension and depth to any modern home. The fiber-dyed wool and durable PET blend of this collection lends the perfect accent to heavily trafficked areas of the home such as living rooms, halls, and entryways."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-daphne-rug-brown-swatch-127767-45347983629','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Daphne Rug (Brown) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983629&a=2893129&m=127767","A classic handwoven construction with clean, contemporary appeal, the Daphne rug brings interest and grounding texture to on-trend spaces. The Daphne rug features a heathered gray and cream colorway with flecks of brown and dark gray, and a ridged weave that adds dimension and depth to any modern home. The fiber-dyed wool and durable PET blend of this collection lends the perfect accent to heavily trafficked areas of the home such as living rooms, halls, and entryways."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-daphne-rug-green-swatch-127767-45347983634','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Daphne Rug (Green) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983634&a=2893129&m=127767","A classic handwoven construction with clean, contemporary appeal, the Daphne rug brings interest and grounding texture to on-trend spaces. The Daphne rug features a heathered green hue with flecks of cream, brown, and beige. A ridged weave adds dimension and depth to any modern home. The fiber-dyed wool and durable PET blend of this collection lends the perfect accent to heavily trafficked areas of the home such as living rooms, halls, and entryways."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-dapper-hare-stocking-holder-127767-45884853035','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Dapper Hare Stocking Holder","60.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45884853035&a=2893129&m=127767","Deck your mantel or shelves with the Dapper Hare stocking Holder. This charming character is crafted from recycled cast aluminum with an antique gold finish, each stocking holder combines playful design with functionality. The weighted base ensures that filled stockings stay securely in place."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-darcy-book-stack-127767-45347983636','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Darcy Book Stack","265.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983636&a=2893129&m=127767","Wrapped in softly tailored gingham, the Darcy Book Stack takes on a gentle, nostalgic charm; their checkered patterns evoke blissful simplicity and quiet elegance. Together, they become not just objects of display, but layered expressions of pattern, history, and home."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-daylon-horn-large-127767-45347983645','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Daylon Horn Large","250.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983645&a=2893129&m=127767","This luxurious sculpture is a bold pairing of two natural elements that make for a wildly chic accent piece. The natural horn has a matte finish and is distinctive when paired with its brass base, transforming it into a sculptural art piece."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-daylon-horn-small-127767-45347983646','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Daylon Horn Small","220.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983646&a=2893129&m=127767","This luxurious sculpture is a bold pairing of two natural elements that make for a wildly chic accent piece. The natural horn has a matte finish and is distinctive when paired with its brass base, transforming it into a sculptural art piece."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-defy-gravity-journal-127767-45347983649','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Defy Gravity Journal","125.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983649&a=2893129&m=127767","Generously scaled with clean, unlined pages, the Defy Gravity Journal invites a free-flowing approach—equally suited for writing, drawing, or collecting thoughts as they come. Crafted with a focus on material and form, this Marilyn Monroe inspired journal offers a sense of enduring appeal, feeling at once iconic and inherently collectible."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-deity-sculpture-127767-46264240126','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Deity Sculpture","120.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46264240126&a=2893129&m=127767","Contemporary sculpture shrunk down to the perfect scale for a tabletop, bookshelf, or etagere. The Deity Sculpture is a delight of modern curves with a unique, blackened zinc finish to contrast a lighter backdrop or add even more depth to a darker setting. Place Deity anywhere you''d like to add a bit of modern fine art sculpture."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-delta-star-accessory-127767-45347983656','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Delta Star Accessory","65.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983656&a=2893129&m=127767","Add sparkle and shine to your home with this striking star. Made of brass-finished iron, it''s durable and decorative, adding a textural statement piece to your home. Place it on shelves, bookcases, or mantles to complete the look of your room."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-destin-ceramic-mini-lamp-ivory-127767-45347983671','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Destin Ceramic Mini Lamp (Ivory)","280.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983671&a=2893129&m=127767","We believe small things can have a big impact. Our Destin Ceramic Mini Lamp, with natural linen shade, features organic flowing waves arranged in a structured geometric base. It’s the perfect size for layering light, tucking into a cozy reading corner or making an unexpected appearance on a coffee station or bookshelf."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-devereux-book-stack-127767-46329699247','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Devereux Book Stack","250.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46329699247&a=2893129&m=127767","Inspired by the storied character of the French Quarter, the Devereux Book Stack layers intricate patterns and timeworn textures in muted blue and natural tones. Its eclectic mix evokes historic interiors gathered over generations, bringing a sense of worldly charm and soulful character to a thoughtfully styled space."]'),
