('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-doolin-mini-book-stack-127767-45347983717','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Doolin Mini Book Stack","210.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983717&a=2893129&m=127767","Scaled down and finished with antique-inspired detailing, the Doolin Mini Book Stack recalls heirloom libraries, tucked-away studies, and treasured finds gathered over time. The result feels storied and distinctive, offering a layered accent that invites a closer look and adds depth in even the smallest moments."]'),
