('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-ellison-sconce-single-antique-brass-127767-45944550732','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Ellison Sconce Single (Antique Brass)","300.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45944550732&a=2893129&m=127767","The Ellison Single Sconce distills the geometry of classic architectural fittings into a compact, dimensional form. A luminous opal glass shade rises above its faceted metal knuckle, while the warm Antiqued Brass finish gives the tailored silhouette a distinct point of view and a soft, inviting glow."]'),
