('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-gathered-budvase-127767-45347983942','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Gathered Budvase","60.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983942&a=2893129&m=127767","With the Gathered Budvase, the name speaks for itself & the style stands out on its own, with or without stems. Featuring 7 unique ceramic budvases in varying heights & styles attached to a rectangular tray, this watertight piece with a glossy white finish brings dimension & playfulness to everyday or event tabletop centerpieces."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-geisel-book-stack-127767-45347983944','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Geisel Book Stack","265.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983944&a=2893129&m=127767","These hardcover books have been transformed into beautiful decorative objects sure to add the punctuation mark to any decor. Each book is deconstructed and reassembled by hand with the finest materials. New spine details are made using scanned 18th and 19th century documents and steel engravings that are printed on beautiful handmade parchment paper that really captures their original elegance. Artfully hand made in the U.S.A."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-gemini-marble-accessory-127767-45347983946','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Gemini Marble Accessory","130.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347983946&a=2893129&m=127767","Each Gemini Marble Accessory, formed from travertine and finished by artisans, is unique and steeped in story. Made in the same tradition as Japanese Kintsugi, which joins together broken pottery to honor the beauty of repair – making the new piece stronger and more resilient than before. Use this piece to symbolize your own story and add interest to any tableau."]'),
