('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-henry-rug-green-swatch-127767-45347984165','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Henry Rug (Green) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347984165&a=2893129&m=127767","The Henry rug blends timeless tradition with a vintage-inspired aesthetic. Featuring a striking central medallion, this rug boasts an elegant ivory and white backdrop, accented by light blue detailing. Its classic pattern and gently distressed finish give it an heirloom feel from the very first step."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-henry-rug-natural-swatch-127767-45347984172','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Henry Rug (Natural) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347984172&a=2893129&m=127767","The Henry rug features a traditional pattern of small medallions set against a warm tan and beige backdrop, highlighted by subtle blue accents. Its vintage, distressed finish adds character and charm, making it feel like a treasured heirloom from the very first step."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-hiro-rug-blue-swatch-127767-45347984182','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Hiro Rug (Blue) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347984182&a=2893129&m=127767","Exceptionally made and artfully designed, this hand-knotted area rug infuses contemporary homes with vintage allure. This wool accent boasts an elegant center medallion and scrolling details for a worldly dose of style. Light gray and blue hues offer a relaxed look to the timeless design."]'),
