('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-intersecting-sculpture-polished-nickel-127767-45347984241','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Intersecting Sculpture (Polished Nickel)","120.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347984241&a=2893129&m=127767","An elegant form of balance and depth, the Intersecting sculpture’s patina finish gives it an industrial vibe. Place this decorative accessory on a bookshelf, etagere, coffee, or side table as a sculptural statement piece."]'),
