('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-karma-dog-bag-127767-45347984328','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Karma Dog Bag","40.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347984328&a=2893129&m=127767","Kar·​ma | ˈkär-mə : destiny or fate, following as effect from cause. Karma proves to be the perfect name for this sweet and loving girl, whose owner was deployed to Iraq when she was just six months old. A fellow soldier in Texas adopted her – and twelve years later she continues to be a loyal companion to the Stone family. Karma spends her days dutifully keeping the bed pillows warm and showing up her two younger brothers when chasing squirrels in the yard. 100% of the proceeds from this bag go"]'),
