('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-lenora-rug-cream-swatch-127767-45347984406','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Lenora Rug (Cream) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347984406&a=2893129&m=127767","The hand-tufted Lenora rug introduces fresh looks inspired by modern Moroccan patterns and neutral colorways. The Ismael design features overlapping stripes in cream and gray hues. Short, gray fringe and 100% wool pile adds to the global appeal. This rug is naturally stain-resistant and works best in low traffic areas of the home such as bedrooms, formal living rooms, formal dining rooms, and sitting rooms."]'),
