('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-ribbon-coral-white-127767-45347985226','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Ribbon Coral (White)","130.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985226&a=2893129&m=127767","A resin replica of ribbon coral is placed on a crystal base for a sophisticated, nature-inspired accent. Add this to a coastal or modern home to bring a slice of the sea indoors — perfect as a paperweight or office accessory."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-rori-ceramic-ripple-vase-127767-45347985252','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Rori Ceramic Ripple Vase","150.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985252&a=2893129&m=127767","The Rori Ripple Vase is defined by its undulating ridges, which evoke the organic texture of coral. Finished in a white glaze and fired twice, the vase has a subtle blue cast that shifts gently in the light."]'),
