('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-savior-vase-set-natural-127767-45347985354','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Savior Vase Set (Natural)","65.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985354&a=2893129&m=127767","Perfect for any occasion, this vase set is as sleek and stylish as it is sustainable. Easily arrange this set to create a modern centerpiece with a multi-level look. Crafted from sustainably sourced mango wood, each piece features a sleek silhouette for a minimalist look that blends well in any space."]'),
