('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-scotty-rug-127767-46508060337','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Scotty Rug","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46508060337&a=2893129&m=127767","Strike the balance between vintage charm and modern sophistication with the Scotty Rug . A true marvel, this rug harmoniously blends traditional handweaving craftsmanship with the precision of modern printing and tufting techniques. With an oriental medallion look, the Wells design is carefully printed on a handwoven base, then overtufted for a uniquely distressed finish. Transform your home with rich texture and a stunning sheen that demands attention."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-seville-horn-bowl-127767-45347985383','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Seville Horn Bowl","80.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985383&a=2893129&m=127767","Handcrafted by artisans from natural horn, our Seville Horn Bowl creates eye-catching interest on its own or when displaying curated objects with special meaning. Contrasting, concentric circles bring visual movement on a console, entryway table or coffee table."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-silas-rug-swatch-127767-45347985407','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Silas Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985407&a=2893129&m=127767","Get in line—this perfectly imperfect stripe pattern strikes a smart balance between blending in and standing out. Hand-spun and hand knotted with 100% Afghan wool, it can handle medium traffic areas with ease. With a textured look and subtle pattern, what''s not to love?"]'),
