('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-tatum-lidded-box-small-set-of-4-127767-45935856693','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Tatum Lidded Box Small (Set of 4)","85.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45935856693&a=2893129&m=127767","Display artisanal style anywhere in the home with the stunning Tatum Lidded Box. This square ceramic box features a removable lid, smooth glossy finish, & a reactive glaze of grey, green, tan, & blue flecked over a neutral off-white base. Each box is unique with surface variation & perfect for hiding trinkets, storing jewelry, & arranging on styled shelves as a decorative home accent. Layer with the coordinating Starling & Freestone Collections for intentional home decor."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-terra-marble-accessory-small-black-127767-45347985719','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Terra Marble Accessory Small (Black)","125.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985719&a=2893129&m=127767","Inspired by a vintage garden sculpture, the Terra Accessory brings a strong, grounding presence to any shelf or tablescape. Carved from inky black marble, its bold wedge form balances smooth polish with raw texture for a touch of textural contrast."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-thea-rug-blue-swatch-127767-45347985722','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Thea Rug (Blue) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985722&a=2893129&m=127767","The Thea collection captivates with eclectic color combinations and standout geometric patterns. The designâ€™s playful blue geometric design features a subtle high-low effect thatâ€™s both vibrant and textural. Adding personality and styleâ€”both indoor and outdoorâ€”has never been easier."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-thea-rug-swatch-127767-45347985734','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Thea Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985734&a=2893129&m=127767","The Thea Rug captivates with eclectic color combinations and striking geometric patterns. The design’s playful blue stripes feature a subtle high-low effect that’s both vibrant and textural. Adding personality and style—both indoor and outdoor—has never been easier."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-thora-vase-127767-45347985738','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Thora Vase","100.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985738&a=2893129&m=127767","Playful stripes & an organic round shape balance out the classic sophistication of the trophy-like foot & handles of the handcrafted terracotta Thora Vase. Featuring a white background with closely spaced, black hand painted horizontal lines that span top to bottom & across the handles, this functional piece offers an eye-catching shape & pattern as shelf decor or on a console in the home."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-thoren-rug-swatch-127767-45347985744','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Thoren Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985744&a=2893129&m=127767","Earthy white and brown tones come together in a mesmerizing linear design, infusing the Thoren rug with contemporary elegance. Hand-knotted from a luxe wool pile, its luminous sheen highlights every intricate detail."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-tybee-rug-swatch-127767-45347985813','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Tybee Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985813&a=2893129&m=127767","A spellbinding combination of soft color and plush texture, the Tybee rug is fashioned of unique hand-spun yarns of wool and silk with rich Tibetan knots. Its imperfect irregularity creates a pleasing motion across the rug. Soft and plush in feel, it is best used in low traffic areas."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-umbrella-base-caster-wheel-set-127767-45347985814','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Umbrella Base Caster Wheel Set","69.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985814&a=2893129&m=127767","Designed to enhance both form and function, the Ball Caster Wheel Set is compatible with all B&P Co. bases and Hemingway Coolers. Each set includes four wheels, crafted from 304 stainless steel with smooth-rolling nylon casters, and a wrench for easy installation."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-vaila-vase-medium-127767-45347985818','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Vaila Vase Medium","120.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985818&a=2893129&m=127767","Nothing quite compares to the unique, artful shape of a Vaila leaf. The Vaila Collection features vases adorned with hand-applied, dimensional Vaila leaves, capturing the essence of nature''s magic. Available in three sizes, each piece has a finish that varies slightly, showcasing a buttery yellow tone reminiscent of Vaila leaves at their peak autumn color. These vases are perfect vessels for floral arrangements or stunning sculptural pieces on a styled shelf."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-vaila-vase-small-127767-45347985819','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Vaila Vase Small","40.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985819&a=2893129&m=127767","Nothing quite compares to the unique, artful shape of a Vaila leaf. The Vaila Collection features vases adorned with hand-applied, dimensional Vaila leaves, capturing the essence of nature''s magic. Available in three sizes, each piece has a finish that varies slightly, showcasing a buttery yellow tone reminiscent of Vaila leaves at their peak autumn color. These vases are perfect vessels for floral arrangements or stunning sculptural pieces on a styled shelf."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-verdelle-ceramic-tray-small-127767-45347985828','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Verdelle Ceramic Tray Small","130.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985828&a=2893129&m=127767","The circular ceramic Verdelle Tray Collection is as artful as it is functional. Each tray features circular cutouts to create shadow and movement, and a glossy glaze to catch light and play with dimension."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-vernazza-rug-red-swatch-127767-45347985835','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Vernazza Rug (Red) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985835&a=2893129&m=127767","The Vernazza Rug takes classic motifs to a whole new level of chic. The Harkness area rug showcases a striking Greek key design in a texture-rich looped and cut pile. Viscose adds a subtle luster and soft feel to the natural wool fibers, while a stunning brown colorway makes a statement.Â"]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-vernazza-rug-swatch-127767-45347985841','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Vernazza Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985841&a=2893129&m=127767","The Vernaza area rug showcases a striking Greek key design in a texture-rich looped and cut pile. Viscose adds a subtle luster and soft feel to the natural wool fibers, while a stunning white colorway with flecks of gray makes a glam statement."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-vesper-rug-swatch-127767-45347985847','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Vesper Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985847&a=2893129&m=127767","The hand knotted Vesper collection features a fresh incarnation of the vintage Turkish textile look. Classic in pattern and modern in color, the Vesper rug boasts a beautiful green palette, featuring distinct dye-lot details and subtle, cream fringe. The artisan-crafted medallion pattern evokes a sense of global style. Made of hand-carded wool, this rug has a low, durable pile for the perfect grounding accent in any medium trafficked spaces like bedrooms, sitting rooms, and formal dining areas. "]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-vintage-unbound-books-set-of-6-127767-45347985872','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Vintage Unbound Books (Set of 6)","90.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985872&a=2893129&m=127767","The perfect, neutral accessory to add texture and interest to a bookcase, etagere, or other display area, these books have a rich color only true vintage paper can boast. Hand-torn edges and bound with natural twine, this set of 6 books is completely unique. Give traditional, transitional, and modern farmhouse-style spaces some character with this classic accessory."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-viper-sconce-polished-nickel-127767-45347985876','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Viper Sconce (Polished Nickel)","75.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985876&a=2893129&m=127767","Clean lines and subtle details combine, making this sconce not only handsome but versatile. The Viper sconce was designed so it could be positioned vertically, horizontally, or even at an angle for an unexpected look. Customize your design style even further with decorative light bulbs. Consider a white frosted globe bulb for a Mid Century vibe or go dark and moody with vintage T bulbs. The Viper sconce is perfect for those narrow, hard-to-fit places in powder rooms or hallways."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-votive-bowl-antique-mercury-127767-45347985886','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Votive Bowl (Antique Mercury)","50.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985886&a=2893129&m=127767","Wearing an Antique Mercury finish, this set of four glass votive bowls is a versatile decorative accent. Place tea candles inside for a warm glow, fill with potpourri for a hint of fragrance, or even plant a succulent inside for a touch of green."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-walk-the-line-journal-127767-45347985887','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Walk the Line Journal","125.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985887&a=2893129&m=127767","Generously scaled with clean, unlined pages, the Walk the Line Journal invites a free-flowing approach—equally suited for writing, drawing, or collecting thoughts as they come. Crafted with a focus on material and form, this Johnny Cash inspired journal offers a sense of enduring appeal, feeling at once iconic and inherently collectible."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-wolfe-sconce-polished-nickel-127767-45347985920','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Wolfe Sconce (Polished Nickel)","120.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985920&a=2893129&m=127767","The Wolfe Sconce is the epitome of versatility. Like a chameleon, it can easily find a charming spot to accentuate in a variety of different styled settings. From a more traditional space to ultra-modern, the Wolfe Sconce''s clean lines and simple form are perfect for adding luxe illumination to a staircase, hallway, entryway, bedroom, living area, or cased opening."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-woodland-fungi-budvase-127767-45813728962','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Woodland Fungi Budvase","55.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45813728962&a=2893129&m=127767","Who knew fungi could be so fun & functional? The recycled cast aluminum Woodland Fungi Budvase in an antique gold finish brings woodland charm to your favorite stems. 2 little tree trunks are hollowed out as watertight budvases, perfect for a few dried or fresh stems. Style on bookshelves, as a centerpiece, or on a console & layer with our other seasonal gold mushrooms as a budvase or decorative object."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-wyatt-rug-grey-swatch-127767-46456587777','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Wyatt Rug (Grey) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46456587777&a=2893129&m=127767","Elegant and casual in the same moment, the Wyatt rug introduces handwoven accents to an array of spaces. The natural, undyed yarns complement a range of palettes and styles, perfectly paired for modern and traditional homes alike. The Wyatt''s design features a grid pattern in an industrial-chic colorway of gray and silver. The tight-looped pile creates a durable accent that suits high and low trafficked spaces such as living rooms, offices, bedrooms, halls, and entryways."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-wyatt-rug-natural-swatch-127767-45347985939','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Wyatt Rug (Natural) Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985939&a=2893129&m=127767","Elegant and casual in the same moment, the Wyatt rug introduces handwoven accents to an array of spaces. The natural, undyed yarns complement a range of palettes and styles, perfectly paired for modern and traditional homes alike. The Wyatt''s design features a stripe pattern in an industrial-chic colorway of cream and light brown. The tight-looped pile creates a durable accent that suits high and low trafficked spaces such as living rooms, offices, bedrooms, halls, and entryways."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-yara-bowl-127767-45347985940','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Yara Bowl","100.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985940&a=2893129&m=127767","With a beautiful one-of-a-kind design, the circular stoneware Yara Bowl offers an organic appeal with its circular, petal-shaped, hand-formed, & hand applied pieces from top to bottom across the exterior. Featuring clean lines but lots of dimension, a glossy finish, & a reactive off-white glaze with hints of natural bisque peeking through, this vessel brings stunning texture & visual interest to home decor."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-zephyr-throw-coral-127767-45347985945','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Zephyr Throw (Coral)","135.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985945&a=2893129&m=127767","Envelope yourself in lightweight comfort with the Zephyr Throw Blanket. Trimmed with hand-knotted tassels, this linen beauty adds a textural accent to sofas, chairs, or beds in your home."]'),
('awin-regina-andrew-detroit-zinnia-rug-swatch-127767-45347985951','Regina Andrew Detroit','home-decor','decor-accents','','["Zinnia Rug Swatch","25.00","USD","Regina Andrew Detroit","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45347985951&a=2893129&m=127767","The Zinnia Rug melds the timelessness of vintage designs with modern, livable style. The rug boasts an elegantly distressed Turkish diamond pattern in contemporary tones of navy, rust, pink, brown, and cream. This low-pile rug is made of soft polyester and features a one-of-a-kind antique rug digitally printed design."]'),
