('awin-trophycentral-artwork-conversion-setup-80917-41923026054','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Artwork Conversion Setup","35","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923026054&a=2893129&m=80917","In order to be properly engraved, all artwork, such as logos, must be in a vector format (ex .EPS or .AI). Vector format files can be created using programs such as Adobe Illustrator and Corel Draw. JPG, BMP and GIF files cannot be properly engraved, since changing the size will distort the image. It is important to note that you cannot simply rename a file to have a .AI or .EPS file type as this does not convert the file format. This is a one-time charge and only required if your artwork is not"]'),
