('awin-trophycentral-rising-star-sales-award-80917-41923025698','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Rising Star Sales Award","147.5","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923025698&a=2893129&m=80917","Precisely cut from optic crystal, the facets of this impressive award promise to shine like a star in the night. A most fitting presentation for your stellar performers. Three sizes: item 7101: 6\"h x 3.5\"w x 1.75\"d, item 7102: 8\"h x 3.5\"w x 1.75d, item 7103: 10\"h x 3.5\"w x 1.75\"d. Not what you want? Click here to see more Sales Awards."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-rose-bowl-80917-41923025847','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Rose Bowl","110.2","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923025847&a=2893129&m=80917","Lead Crystal. Available in 3 sizes. Small Size: 6? H x 7.75? W Etch Area: 1.75? H x 2.5? W. Medium Size: 7? H x 7.75? W Etch Area: 2.5? H x 3.25? W. Large Size: 8? H x 7.75? W Etch Area: 2.75? H x 3.5? W."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-royce-leather-euro-commuter-wallet-80917-41923023204','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Royce Leather Euro Commuter Wallet","42.5","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923023204&a=2893129&m=80917","A new twist on a classic Bi-Fold. Made in Top Grain Nappa Leather the left side has a dual flip open section to reveal two ID windows and 5 credit card pockets. The right side has a zippered change compartment. To complete the interior there are two bill pockets with the back one being leather lined. Close it up an on the back is an additional wide slot pocket. This is completed with a 6 flip picture/credit card insert. Measures 4 1/2 x 3 1/2 closed."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-silvertone-clock-80917-41923023289','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["Silvertone Clock","136.5","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923023289&a=2893129&m=80917","You''ll reward with style when you present our very dimensional Silvertone Clock. Features a Japanese quartz movement and a satin finish bezel that plays well with its frosted facets. Measures 8.5h x 6.75w x 1.25d."]'),
('awin-trophycentral-the-magic-wallet-80917-41923023229','TrophyCentral','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','','["The Magic Wallet","22.56","USD","TrophyCentral","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41923023229&a=2893129&m=80917","Top grain Nappa leather Magic Wallet and business card case. Four outside pockets hold business cards or credit cards, the interior has 4 elastic straps to \"magically\" keep your currency and cards securely in line. Measures 4 x 2 1/2 x 1/4."]'),
